{"id":"be621e69300ce514","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-ilm-proper-extension.md","title":"ILM严格扩张IL","display":"thm-ilm-proper-extension — ILM严格扩张IL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-ilm-proper-extension","aliases":["72-thm-ilm-proper-extension"],"display":"thm-ilm-proper-extension — ILM严格扩张IL","depends_on":["[[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]]","[[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §13; local explicit separation using the new countermodel","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-ilm-proper-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-ilm-proper-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ilm-proper-extension — ILM严格扩张IL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"585b23d932148aa0\" href=\"?note=585b23d932148aa0\" title=\"72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame\">72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de3f2ba1fa9eb703\" href=\"?note=de3f2ba1fa9eb703\" title=\"72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness\">72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §13; local explicit separation using the new countermodel"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_*:=(p_0\\triangleright p_1)\\to_m((p_0\\land_m\\Box_m p_2)\\triangleright(p_1\\land_m\\Box_m p_2))\">\\(M_*:=(p_0\\triangleright p_1)\\to_m((p_0\\land_m\\Box_m p_2)\\triangleright(p_1\\land_m\\Box_m p_2))\\)</span>；IL、ILM 为本册定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IL}\\subsetneq\\mathsf{ILM},\\qquad M_*\\in\\mathsf{ILM}\\setminus\\mathsf{IL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{IL}\\subsetneq\\mathsf{ILM},\\qquad M_*\\in\\mathsf{ILM}\\setminus\\mathsf{IL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该式是加入 ILM 的一个 M 公理实例。四世界 Veltman 反模型使其为假，IL 可靠性排除它为 IL 定理；公理及阶段闭包的单调性给定理集包含。因而严格性由具体反模型见证，没有调用尚未重建的一般解释性算术完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame","status":"resolved","id":"585b23d932148aa0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"de3f2ba1fa9eb703","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M_*:=(p_0\\triangleright p_1)\\to_m((p_0\\land_m\\Box_m p_2)\\triangleright(p_1\\land_m\\Box_m p_2))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IL}\\subsetneq\\mathsf{ILM},\\qquad M_*\\in\\mathsf{ILM}\\setminus\\mathsf{IL}.","display":true}],"bytes":1312,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm